{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73511","main_id":73511,"main_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","main_description":"在阿如村附近，你遇到了一名神色焦急的学者…","chapter_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7351101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7351101,"sequence":15,"variant":0,"line_id":735110117,"next_line_ids":[735110118,735110119],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4403,"speaker_text_hash":2551148232,"speaker":"福迪尔","speaker_raw":"福迪尔","text_hash":312315898,"text":"——是一群沙虫。也不知道为什么，它们的性情最近变得异常凶暴，还会潜藏在沙暴里袭击过往的猎物。","raw_text":"——是一群沙虫。也不知道为什么，它们的性情最近变得异常凶暴，还会潜藏在沙暴里袭击过往的猎物。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7351101.json"}
