{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73511","main_id":73511,"main_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","main_description":"在阿如村附近，你遇到了一名神色焦急的学者…","chapter_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7351101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7351101,"sequence":18,"variant":0,"line_id":735110121,"next_line_ids":[735110122],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4403,"speaker_text_hash":2551148232,"speaker":"福迪尔","speaker_raw":"福迪尔","text_hash":890385298,"text":"有沙暴作掩护，也很难对它们造成多大的伤害。一觉得有危险，那些家伙就会立刻逃走…","raw_text":"有沙暴作掩护，也很难对它们造成多大的伤害。一觉得有危险，那些家伙就会立刻逃走…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7351101.json"}
