{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73511","main_id":73511,"main_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","main_description":"在阿如村附近，你遇到了一名神色焦急的学者…","chapter_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7351103,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7351103,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":735110307,"next_line_ids":[735110308],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30342,"speaker_text_hash":1180019760,"speaker":"维纳亚克","speaker_raw":"维纳亚克","text_hash":142463746,"text":"同伴？难道是施芮娅？不对啊，她明明说，就算我被魔物抓走也不管我了…","raw_text":"同伴？难道是施芮娅？不对啊，她明明说，就算我被魔物抓走也不管我了…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7351103.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73511","main_id":73511,"main_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","main_description":"在阿如村附近，你遇到了一名神色焦急的学者…","chapter_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7351103,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7351103,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":735110308,"next_line_ids":[735110309],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30342,"speaker_text_hash":1180019760,"speaker":"维纳亚克","speaker_raw":"维纳亚克","text_hash":3853575738,"text":"啊——我明白了，她是让你们俩来回收零件的吧！","raw_text":"啊——我明白了，她是让你们俩来回收零件的吧！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7351103.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73511","main_id":73511,"main_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","main_description":"在阿如村附近，你遇到了一名神色焦急的学者…","chapter_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7351103,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7351103,"sequence":8,"variant":0,"line_id":735110309,"next_line_ids":[735110310],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30342,"speaker_text_hash":1180019760,"speaker":"维纳亚克","speaker_raw":"维纳亚克","text_hash":4258170498,"text":"我有没有被抓走无所谓，零件没人回收了可是大事…嗯，像是她会说的话，合情合理。","raw_text":"我有没有被抓走无所谓，零件没人回收了可是大事…嗯，像是她会说的话，合情合理。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7351103.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73511","main_id":73511,"main_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","main_description":"在阿如村附近，你遇到了一名神色焦急的学者…","chapter_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7351103,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7351103,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":735110310,"next_line_ids":[735110311],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":4059750178,"text":"…你就当是这样吧。","raw_text":"…你就当是这样吧。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7351103.json"}
