{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73511","main_id":73511,"main_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","main_description":"在阿如村附近，你遇到了一名神色焦急的学者…","chapter_title":"沙漠虫害·开题","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7351103,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7351103,"sequence":12,"variant":0,"line_id":735110313,"next_line_ids":[735110314],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30342,"speaker_text_hash":1180019760,"speaker":"维纳亚克","speaker_raw":"维纳亚克","text_hash":604692034,"text":"唉，要是没我在，施芮娅又那么笨手笨脚的…还有谁能照料好这些机械啊！","raw_text":"唉，要是没我在，施芮娅又那么笨手笨脚的…还有谁能照料好这些机械啊！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7351103.json"}
